<navigation-bar title="加入照护" back="{{false}}" color="#3d302a" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="my-nav" bindtap="goBack"><view/></view></navigation-bar><scroll-view class="my-scroll" scroll-y><view class="my-shell"><view class="my-card"><text class="my-title">一起照顾宝宝的每一餐</text><text wx:if="{{loading}}" class="my-sub">正在核对邀请…</text><view wx:elif="{{errorMessage}}" class="my-error">{{errorMessage}}<button class="my-secondary" bindtap="load">重新核对</button></view><block wx:else><text class="my-sub">受邀权限：{{roleLabel}}</text><block wx:if="{{state==='UNCLAIMED'}}"><input class="my-input" maxlength="40" placeholder="填写自己的称呼，让邀请人确认" value="{{displayName}}" bindinput="setName"/><text class="my-sub">管理员批准后可查看这个宝宝的既有记录。你原有的宝宝和家庭会保留，不会合并或删除。</text><button class="my-primary" bindtap="apply" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">确认申请加入</button></block><block wx:elif="{{state==='PENDING'}}"><text class="my-sub">申请已发送，等待管理员批准。批准前不会开放宝宝资料。</text><button class="my-secondary" bindtap="load">查看审批结果</button></block><block wx:elif="{{state==='APPROVED'}}"><text class="my-sub">已批准。现在可以切换到共享宝宝。</text><button class="my-primary" bindtap="enter">切换并查看记录</button></block><text wx:else class="my-sub">申请已结束，请联系管理员重新邀请。</text></block></view><button class="my-secondary" bindtap="goBack">{{state==='UNCLAIMED'?'暂不申请，返回我的':'返回我的'}}</button></view></scroll-view>
